he same name of the game that  he uses when he's trying to perform the  dembele chant on tyler in the third  movie could we just play hide and seek  what do you call this game anyway hide  the soul we are led to believe that he's  successful making this his first  successful transfer from the doll body  into a human body again they could have  ended the movie there and i probably  would have been satisfied but we would  have missed out on the post-credits  scene for the first time in over 14  years were reintroduced to andy barkley  who receives a package before his  birthday from the hottest delivery  person that i've ever seen we hear him  on the phone with his mom when he says  this yeah i'm definitely coming for my  birthday tomorrow back in the original  movie chucky was his birthday present  from his mom to him which means chucky  is attacking him one day shy of the  anniversary of their first meeting he  also asks how's mike doing he's  presumably talking about mike norris the  police officer that helped save him and  his mom all of those years ago it's nice  to see that they kept in touch there are  a lot of interesting items in andy's  apartment we see a picture of him and  his mom from when he was six a picture  of kyle from child's play too which is  actually a clue that they're still in  contact as we would see in the next  movie you can also see his diploma from  kent military academy which tells us  that despite getting arrested at the end  of child's play 3 he was still able to  finish school and graduate which also  kind of leads into the next movie cult  of chucky where we see his familiarity  with guns from the academy has stuck  with him over the years but if you want  to hear me talk about cult of chucky  then you'll have to join me in the next  episode of things you missed when that  video comes out you'll find it there on  the left but in the meantime make sure  you subscribe to cz's world for new  horrors every week ring the death bell  and select all notifications and i will  see you in the next one assuming we both  survive  [Music]
 

